      "side": 1,
      "message": "This just helps narrow the range, since we know that if x \u003c rmax, sqrt(x) \u003c sqrt(rmax). And sqrt(0x7fffffff) \u003c 0xb504 \u003c 0x7fff.\n\n(yes, this function could do better...)",
